# RSpec Testing

## Setup

- Specs in `spec/` (not `test/` — Minitest is legacy)
- Factories in `spec/factories/` via FactoryBot
- Shoulda-matchers for associations/validations
- Support: `spec/support/factory_bot.rb`, `shoulda_matchers.rb`

## Run

```bash
docker compose exec app bundle exec rspec
docker compose exec app bundle exec rspec spec/requests/api/v1/words_spec.rb
```

## Model specs

- Test: validations, associations, public instance/class methods
- Cover edge cases: empty collections, zero division, scoped uniqueness, `~` counter prefix
- Use `build` vs `create` intentionally (`tag!` builds unsaved `word_tags`)

## Request specs (preferred over controller specs)

- Type: `type: :request`
- Assert status, JSON shape, pagination, 404 `{ error: "Not found" }`
- Use factories — avoid YAML fixtures (duplicate `content` values break uniqueness)

## Factory patterns

```ruby
factory :word do
  sequence(:content) { |n| "word#{n}" }
end
```
